From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tinycast Recipe <recipe@localhost>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 12:45:37 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] tinycast-space 0028: settings search prefix
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

`?` or `?text` in the launcher searches Tinycast's own settings through upstream's `SettingsSearchCatalog` (new `SettingsSearchScreen.swift`): a bare `?` lists the panes, ↵ opens Settings at the pane or row, ⌘1–⌘9 open the Nth row, and File Search stays out of it. After [mSarheed/pipcast](https://github.com/mSarheed/pipcast/commit/f337e4ea).

Origin: tinycast-space 0028-settings-search-prefix.patch @ ffccfc3
